# Dwarven Mattock: "When this Equipment enters, attach it to target Dwarf you control. Equipped creature gets +2/+2 and has ward {1}."
# Bot1 controls two Dwarven Provisioners (2/2 Dwarves), an Ornithopter and Bot2 has a Dwarf too: only Bot1's Dwarves may be chosen
# (the Ornithopter and Bot2's Dwarf are refused), and the Mattock attaches to the one chosen, #2, making it a 4/4 while #1 stays 2/2.
# The ward {1} it grants is a counter-unless-pays: Bot2's Bolt at the equipped Dwarf declines to pay and is countered, the Dwarf
# unmarked (CR 702.21a, 701.3a, 301.5).

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Dwarven Provisioner
Dwarven Provisioner
Dwarven Mattock
Ornithopter
Island x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Mox Ruby
Dwarven Provisioner
Lightning Bolt
Island x2
Island x10

